      "id": "stg_theory",
      "type": "lecture",
      "title": "Concepto Teórico: Adverbios de Modo",
      "parts": [
        { "visual": "Los adjetivos describen sustantivos (a quick process). Los ADVERBIOS describen verbos, es decir, CÓMO hacemos algo (we process it quickly). La mayoría se forman añadiendo -ly: quick -> quickly (rápidamente), efficient -> efficiently (eficientemente).", "audio": "Adjectives describe nouns, like a quick process. ADVERBS describe verbs, meaning HOW we do something. For example, we process it quickly. Most adverbs are formed by adding L-Y: quick becomes quickly, efficient becomes efficiently." },
        { "visual": "Irregulares importantes: good (bueno) -> well (bien). fast (rápido) -> fast (rápido). hard (duro) -> hard (duro). He is a good worker -> He works well. She is a fast typist -> She types fast.", "audio": "Important irregulars: good becomes well. Fast stays fast. Hard stays hard. He is a good worker, he works well. She is a fast typist, she types fast." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "stg_quiz_choice",
      "type": "quiz_choice",
      "title": "Interactive Quiz",
      "description": "Elige el adverbio (o adjetivo) correcto según el contexto.",
      "questions": [
        { "id": "a1-123-q1", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "She works very ____. (Eficientemente).", "options": ["efficiently", "efficient", "efficientness", "efficienter"], "correct_answer": "efficiently", "explanation": "Adverbio: efficiently (describiendo cómo trabaja)." },
        { "id": "a1-123-q2", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "He is a very ____ worker. (Eficiente).", "options": ["efficient", "efficiently", "efficientness", "efficiency"], "correct_answer": "efficient", "explanation": "Adjetivo: efficient (describiendo a worker)." },
        { "id": "a1-123-q3", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "Please reply to this email ____. (Rápidamente).", "options": ["quickly", "quick", "quicker", "quickness"], "correct_answer": "quickly", "explanation": "Adverbio: quickly." },
        { "id": "a1-123-q4", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "The team performed ____ in the project. (Bien).", "options": ["well", "good", "goodly", "better"], "correct_answer": "well", "explanation": "Adverbio de good = well." },
        { "id": "a1-123-q5", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "That was a ____ presentation. (Buena).", "options": ["good", "well", "goodly", "better"], "correct_answer": "good", "explanation": "Adjetivo para presentation = good." },
        { "id": "a1-123-q6", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "We need to act ____. (Rápido - adverbio irregular).", "options": ["fast", "fastly", "faster", "fastness"], "correct_answer": "fast", "explanation": "Fast es igual como adjetivo y adverbio. (Fastly no existe)." },
        { "id": "a1-123-q7", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "They are working very ____ right now. (Duro - adverbio irregular).", "options": ["hard", "hardly", "harder", "hardness"], "correct_answer": "hard", "explanation": "Hard (duro/arduamente) es adverbio. (Hardly significa 'apenas')." },
        { "id": "a1-123-q8", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "Please handle these documents ____. (Cuidadosamente).", "options": ["carefully", "careful", "care", "careless"], "correct_answer": "carefully", "explanation": "Adverbio: carefully." },
        { "id": "a1-123-q9", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "He spoke very ____ during the meeting. (Claramente).", "options": ["clearly", "clear", "clearness", "clearer"], "correct_answer": "clearly", "explanation": "Adverbio: clearly." },
        { "id": "a1-123-q10", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "We successfully and ____ finished the task. (Fácilmente).", "options": ["easily", "easy", "easier", "easiness"], "correct_answer": "easily", "explanation": "Adverbio: easily (la 'y' cambia a 'i' + ly)." },
        { "id": "a1-123-q11", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "The CEO explained the strategy ____. (Perfectamente).", "options": ["perfectly", "perfect", "perfection", "perfectness"], "correct_answer": "perfectly", "explanation": "Adverbio: perfectly." },
        { "id": "a1-123-q12", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "She always arrives ____ to the office. (Temprano).", "options": ["early", "earlier", "earliest", "earlyly"], "correct_answer": "early", "explanation": "Early es igual como adjetivo y adverbio." },
        { "id": "a1-123-q13", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "He often arrives ____. (Tarde).", "options": ["late", "lately", "later", "latest"], "correct_answer": "late", "explanation": "Late es adverbio. (Lately significa 'últimamente')." },
        { "id": "a1-123-q14", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "Listen ____ to the instructions. (Atentamente / Cuidadosamente).", "options": ["carefully", "careful", "care", "caring"], "correct_answer": "carefully", "explanation": "Listen carefully." },
        { "id": "a1-123-q15", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "The machine is running ____. (Suavemente/Sin problemas).", "options": ["smoothly", "smooth", "smoother", "smoothness"], "correct_answer": "smoothly", "explanation": "Adverbio: smoothly." },
        { "id": "a1-123-q16", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "We must complete this project ____. (Exitosamente).", "options": ["successfully", "successful", "success", "succeed"], "correct_answer": "successfully", "explanation": "Adverbio: successfully." },
        { "id": "a1-123-q17", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "She types very ____. (Rápidamente).", "options": ["quickly", "quick", "fastly", "quickness"], "correct_answer": "quickly", "explanation": "Adverbio: quickly." },
        { "id": "a1-123-q18", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "The system was updated ____. (Automáticamente).", "options": ["automatically", "automatic", "automatical", "automates"], "correct_answer": "automatically", "explanation": "Adverbio: automatically." },
        { "id": "a1-123-q19", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "We communicate ____ via email. (Regularmente).", "options": ["regularly", "regular", "regulars", "regularity"], "correct_answer": "regularly", "explanation": "Adverbio: regularly." },
        { "id": "a1-123-q20", "type": "quiz_choice", "question": "He answered the questions ____. (Pobremente / Mal).", "options": ["poorly", "poor", "poorest", "poorness"], "correct_answer": "poorly", "explanation": "Adverbio: poorly." }
      ]
